          "en": "To conclude, let me restate the central question: how is pedagogical knowledge transmitted between two asymmetric national spaces? My answer, in one sentence: through human mediators that institutional histories tend to obscure. These are the main results I submit for your appraisal. Thank you for your attention; I remain at your disposal for your questions.",
